---
---
<section class="rc" id="receipts" aria-labelledby="h-rc">
  <div class="rc-pin" id="rc-pin">
    <div class="rc-stage">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow o center">Receipts</p>
        <h2 class="h-l" id="h-rc">Every byte gets <br>a receipt.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="orbit" id="orbit">
        <div class="anchor" id="a-rc"><img class="still" src="/img/icon-front-dark.webp" alt="" width="512" height="512" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
        <div class="ocard" data-c><span class="ico" style="--c:#e87a2e"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-up"/></svg></span><span class="m"><span class="t">Checked for a Skovern update</span><span class="s">github.com · 0.4 KB out</span></span><span class="tag t-out">Out ↑</span></div>
        <div class="ocard" data-c><span class="ico" style="--c:#30d158"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-house"/></svg></span><span class="m"><span class="t">Chat: Autumn wreath captions</span><span class="s">your computer · stayed here</span></span><span class="tag t-local">Local</span></div>
        <div class="ocard" data-c><span class="ico" style="--c:#e87a2e"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-up"/></svg></span><span class="m"><span class="t">Read a website for a skill</span><span class="s">bloomandvine.shop · 0.6 KB out</span></span><span class="tag t-out">Out ↑</span></div>
        <div class="ocard" data-c><span class="ico" style="--c:#0a84ff"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-down"/></svg></span><span class="m"><span class="t">Downloaded your brain</span><span class="s">Qwen2.5 14B · 9.0 GB in</span></span><span class="tag t-in">In ↓</span></div>
        <div class="ocard" data-c><span class="ico" style="--c:#30d158"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-house"/></svg></span><span class="m"><span class="t">Reply to a grumpy review</span><span class="s">your computer · nothing left</span></span><span class="tag t-local">Local</span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="lede">When anything leaves your computer, Skovern writes it down: where it went, how much, and why. <b>You can read the whole list any time.</b></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
